# Judge5-2-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:老实说，<br>我觉得<br>这种微不足道的伤口<br>并不重要……<br>但我会奉陪到底，<br>直到你<br>满意为止。|#0105Trial02_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:奈叶香<br>嘴里的伤口……<br>如果你说那很重要的话，<br>那么伤口是<br>怎么造成的呢？|#0105Trial02_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:先不说<br>伤口在嘴里这件事，<br>我们还没发现<br>能造成那种伤口的<br>利器吧？<br>但你肯定能<br>说明这一点，对吧？|#0105Trial02_Margo003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这、这……！|#0105Trial02_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"如果存在<br>某种<link=\"Objection_01_05_02_01\">凶器</link>，<br>凶手会不会<br>把它拿走了……？<br>|#0105Trial02_Meruru001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR6,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"要不要搜身？<br>毕竟目前<br>确实<link=\"Objection_01_05_02_02\">没发现</link>。<br>|#0105Trial02_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"安全箱里的<br>斧头，<br>还有<link=\"Objection_01_05_02_03\">保险箱里的剑</link>，<br>这些虽然是利器，<br>但刀刃部分<br>太大了，<br>应该没关系吧……|#0105Trial02_Coco001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:也就是说，<br>艾玛的推理<br>从一开始<br>就完全不成立。<br>|#0105Trial02_Margo005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


